## What the AI should do

Tell the AI to:

- Keep the design consistent with buyer and seller pages
- Use the existing admin structure instead of rebuilding everything
- Follow the current section IDs and sidebar logic
- Keep buttons, cards, and modals visually aligned
- Fix the root cause instead of applying temporary patches

## What the AI should not do

Tell the AI not to:

- Break the sidebar navigation
- Change unrelated pages
- Remove existing admin sections
- Replace the design with a completely different style
- Hardcode sample data unless it is only for testing or placeholders

